WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.780
in this video I'm going to demonstrate

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:06.210
how you can use the slide master view to

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:07.560
make changes to one slate which will

00:00:06.210 --> 00:00:09.450
then be applied to every subsequent

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:13.440
slate that you insert into the

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:15.630
presentation so what I need to do is I

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:17.730
need another gate up to the View tab and

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:20.390
under view tab I would need a select

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:23.130
slate master so that's an X late master

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:25.170
that will take me into slate master view

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:27.150
now don't worry too much that all of the

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:29.400
information from your original

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:31.619
presentation isn't visible it is

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:34.500
actually still there all this is doing

00:00:31.619 --> 00:00:37.320
is its defining the content the layout

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:39.030
the design the fonts the background

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:41.360
images and the theme that you may be

00:00:39.030 --> 00:00:45.270
using or wish to use for each

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:46.950
presentation so one of the things to

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:48.300
remember is that if you wish to make a

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:51.750
change that will be applied to all

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:54.030
slates you need to select slide 1 now

00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:56.280
I'm going to insert the company logo and

00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:58.160
so our selected slide 1 and all I need

00:00:56.280 --> 00:01:03.449
to do then is go to the insert tab

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:05.159
select picture from this device navigate

00:01:03.449 --> 00:01:08.729
to the image double click on the image

00:01:05.159 --> 00:01:10.740
and it inserts it into the slate I can

00:01:08.729 --> 00:01:13.260
just move that up to the top and then

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:16.020
I'll resize that make it quite small and

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:19.680
I'll also change the transparency so

00:01:16.020 --> 00:01:23.189
it's very clear and I'm happy with that

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:24.990
again if I make a change to the font so

00:01:23.189 --> 00:01:27.119
if I change the font there if I go to

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:29.280
the Home tab and it Calibri late

00:01:27.119 --> 00:01:36.960
headings 44 at the moment if I change

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:38.939
that to Arial and see 54 when I come out

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:41.220
of the slide mater so I have to click on

00:01:38.939 --> 00:01:43.259
the slide master tab again and close for

00:01:41.220 --> 00:01:45.750
slate master view that will

00:01:43.259 --> 00:01:48.119
automatically change the size of the

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:52.020
font and as you can also see the image

00:01:48.119 --> 00:01:54.270
has been placed at the top of every

00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:57.540
slate within the presentation if I go to

00:01:54.270 --> 00:02:02.159
a new slate and select a blank slate

00:01:57.540 --> 00:02:04.619
again another tail slate it

00:02:02.159 --> 00:02:08.509
automatically adds up and the font is

00:02:04.619 --> 00:02:11.670
automatically going to be Arial size 60

00:02:08.509 --> 00:02:13.690
so if I go back to the view and select

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:16.150
slide master again

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:18.670
go back to slate one I can also change

00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:20.530
the theme so if I decided that I wasn't

00:02:18.670 --> 00:02:22.780
happy with the theme that I had and I

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:24.250
wanted to change it for all slides in

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:27.420
the presentation and all subsequent

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:31.210
slate I could select a theme that I was

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:34.810
happy with and then from there once I've

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:40.630
got that I could then close the master

00:02:34.810 --> 00:02:42.970
view and again that will change the

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:45.120
theme for every slide in the

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:45.120
presentation